  "title": "Common Rail Pressure Low Error 1",
  "action_level": "L01",
  "detail_of_failure": "Pressure low error (level 1) occurs in the common rail circuit.",
  "controller_action": null,
  "machine_effect": "• The engine does not start or startability is not good. • Exhaust gas color becomes black. • Engine output is reduced.",
  "related_information": "• Common rail pressure can be checked with monitoring function (Code: 36400). • After the repair is done, check that the failure code is not shown with the operation that follows. Procedure: Start the engine.",
  "format": "B",
  "pdf_pages": [
    789,
